{"root":"suasana","ipa":"/su.a.sa.na/","core":"指环境、氛围、气氛或某种特定的情境，既可指物理环境，也可指心理或社交层面的氛围。","pos":["名词"],"scenes":["高频","工作","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/su.a.sa.na/","zh":"氛围，气氛，环境","phrases":[{"t":"suasana hati","zh":"心情，情绪"},{"t":"suasana kerja","zh":"工作氛围"},{"t":"menciptakan suasana","zh":"营造气氛"}],"examples":[{"t":"Suasana di dalam ruangan itu sangat tenang.","zh":"房间里的气氛非常宁静。"},{"t":"Dia berusaha mencairkan suasana yang kaku.","zh":"他试图缓和僵硬的气氛。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"suasana","ipa":"/su.a.sa.na/","zh":"氛围，气氛","phrase":{"t":"suasana meriah","zh":"热闹的气氛"},"example":{"t":"Suasana pesta sangat meriah.","zh":"派对的气氛非常热闹。"}},{"w":"bersuasana","ipa":"/bər.su.a.sa.na/","zh":"具有某种氛围的","phrase":{"t":"bersuasana romantis","zh":"具有浪漫氛围的"},"example":{"t":"Restoran itu bersuasana romantis.","zh":"那家餐厅有着浪漫的氛围。"}},{"w":"menyuasanakan","ipa":"/mə.ɲu.a.sa.na.kan/","zh":"使具有某种氛围","phrase":{"t":"menyuasanakan ruangan","zh":"使房间具有某种氛围"},"example":{"t":"Lampu redup menyuasanakan ruangan menjadi lebih intim.","zh":"昏暗的灯光使房间的氛围变得更加亲密。"}}],"derSlugs":["suasana","bersuasana","menyuasanakan"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-27T16:36:56.759Z","src":"base"}